  "details": "My god why is this a thing. Game crashed while in a world, log back in and when I join the instance which is most certainly not full (I made the damned world, there were only 6 of us out of the 20 max that I set), I get an endless black screen. This used to eventually boot you back to your home world but now it doesn't do ANYTHING. Seriously why the HELL does this happen and why is it not fixed.\n\nEDIT-Ok fine you fixed the black screen issue now I just get sent to a new empty instance when the instance I WAS in clearly IS NOT FULL FIX IT!!!!!",
